ause that was  hers that was her baby that was her  dream  i know she really wanted some people to  know to actually that's to be vaccinated  to still  mess up  you know is very imperative that we  still mess up  angel was buried over the weekend her  mother buried her in one of the dresses  that was sold at her store and angelle's  mom tells us she plans to keep that  store  up and running  one more thing before we go the leading  health officer here in louisiana said  just on friday that  100 people here in louisiana have died  after being fully vaccinated 23 within  the last week but he made this point he  said the median age of people who are  those breakthrough cases and getting  really sick and dying the median age is  74 years old and the vast majority of  those people  all have pretty severe underlying  conditions  gail  that's good to remember thank you david

